on exitFrame
  [  0] pushcons 0 .............................. <EMPTY>
  [  2] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [  5] set 0 ................................... set the keyDownScript to EMPTY
  [  7] pushint8 7 .............................. <7>
  [ 10] pushcons 8 .............................. <"hezstnd">
  [ 12] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 13] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 16] get 9 ................................... <the number of member "hezstnd">
  [ 18] pushint8 35 ............................. <35>
  [ 21] set 6 ................................... set the memberNum of sprite 7 to the number of member "hezstnd"
  [ 23] pushint8 9 .............................. <9>
  [ 26] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 27] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <9, 0>
  [ 29] extcall 15 .............................. puppetSprite(9, 0)
  [ 31] ret
end
